# The batch files are deliberately pure ASCII with CRLF endings. cmd.exe is
# unreliable with LF-only batch files, so without this pin a clone on a machine
# with `core.autocrlf=input` would check them out as LF and the documented
# one-click entry point could silently misbehave.
*.bat text eol=crlf
*.cmd text eol=crlf

# Never let git attempt line-ending conversion or text diffs on binaries
*.exe binary
*.db binary
*.png binary
*.jpg binary
*.ico binary
